# Yamaha TX81Z voice editor for the EUCLID edition of the Polyend Tracker.
# Generated by euclid-synths/tools/edisyn_tx81z.py from Edisyn's Yamaha4Op.java
# (https://github.com/eclab/edisyn, Apache License 2.0, Copyright Sean Luke).
# Edits the TX81Z's voice edit buffer with VCED and ACED parameter changes.
synth "Yamaha TX81Z"
pause 30
device 1
port din
template vced F0 43 d+10 12 p v F7
template aced F0 43 d+10 13 p v F7
request F0 43 d+20 7E 4C 4D 20 20 38 39 37 36 41 45 F7
